== test_bug2_soring_stale_head ==
Architecture: x86_64 (TSO).
SORING uses relaxed-head + acquire-fence idiom.
On x86 the fence is a no-op at HW level, but the C11
synchronization is equivalent to an acquire load.
Total enq=400000 deq=400000
soring <soring_bug2>@0x11032e4c0
  size=128
  capacity=64
  esize=8
  msize=0
  used=0
  avail=64
  cons.sync_type=MT
  cons.head=400000
  cons.tail=400000
  prod.sync_type=MT
  prod.head=400000
  prod.tail=400000
  nb_stage=2
  stage[0].tail.pos=400000
  stage[0].tail.sync=0
  stage[0].head=400000
  stage[1].tail.pos=400000
  stage[1].tail.sync=0
  stage[1].head=400000
PASS: SORING drained cleanly under stress on x86 TSO.
